    <briefdescription>
<para>Reverse path iterator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is an input iterator that iterates over the individual components in <emphasis>path</emphasis> in reverse order. The traversal order is exactly reversed from that of <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1sys_1_1path_1_1const__iterator" kindref="compound">const_iterator</ref></emphasis> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
